# Opinion

Meeting: 0025-configure-oidc-fallback-and-registration
Agent: ArchitectB
Task: configure oidc fallback and registration
Context:
- Need a graceful experience when OIDC settings are missing.
- Basic auth fallback keeps the UI usable without remote sync.
Position:
- Support local basic auth only when OIDC is incomplete; keep remote sync locked behind full OIDC config.
Recommendations:
- Ensure the UI messaging makes the offline/local-only mode obvious.
- Maintain strict HTTPS/JWKS enforcement when OIDC is provided.
